# The app runs fully locally with its built-in engine by default: no API key, no cost.
#
# Optional AI mode (uses Anthropic API credits): Claude structures the JD, finds semantic
# equivalents and writes rewrites. To turn it on, copy this file to .env.local and set:
# ATS_AI=claude
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...        (not needed if it's already set on your Windows account)
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5     (optional override)
